From: autoware-qnx-guardian
Subject: [PATCH] autoware_vehicle_cmd_gate: depend on autoware_utils sub-packages instead of autoware_utils

Use autoware_utils_rclcpp (polling subscriber, update_param), autoware_utils_logging (LoggerLevelConfigure), autoware_utils_debug (PublishedTimePublisher) and autoware_utils_system (StopWatch) directly.

Why: the autoware_utils metapackage depends on autoware_utils_pcl -> pcl_ros/PCL,
which is not available on QNX 8.0 and is out of scope for this port. The package
only uses forwarding headers from autoware_utils; depending on the sub-packages they
forward to is behaviour-identical and builds unchanged on Linux.

Upstream: TODO (autoware_universe PR: narrow autoware_utils deps to sub-packages)
Applies to: autoware_universe 6e477c645efec33f7909095eea684474e97f5e3d (0.52.0)
